Hello?

160
00:14:47,337 --> 00:14:48,496
Hello Wei

161
00:14:48,705 --> 00:14:50,029
Tung, you are early today

162
00:14:50,237 --> 00:14:51,032
You don't have to work?

163
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,534
