187
00:18:09,894 --> 00:18:11,226
Why did you ask for me?

188
00:18:11,495 --> 00:18:13,174
Would you like coffee or tea?

189
00:18:13,907 --> 00:18:15,354
What do you want from me?

190
00:18:15,562 --> 00:18:16,822
Coffee?

191
00:18:18,394 --> 00:18:19,792
