243
00:23:07,582 --> 00:23:08,980
Find someone else

244
00:23:09,948 --> 00:23:11,141
Answer me

245
00:23:11,349 --> 00:23:12,846
You don't know what to say

246
00:23:13,055 --> 00:23:15,064
