264
00:24:55,011 --> 00:24:56,169
Not bad

265
00:24:56,610 --> 00:24:59,473
We had a long talk mostly about you

266
00:25:00,416 --> 00:25:02,442
My mom's been like this for a while

267
00:25:02,651 --> 00:25:03,803
She can't talk

268
00:25:04,243 --> 00:25:07,868
